     "statement": "$z_1=2\\left(\\cos\\frac\\pi6+i\\sin\\frac\\pi6\\right)$, $z_2=3\\left(\\cos\\frac\\pi3+i\\sin\\frac\\pi3\\right)$. Find $z_1z_2$.",
